    "encrypted": "false",
    "long_instructions": "## Broken Password Generator\r\n\r\n1. Enter a length, click **Generate Password**, and compare the expected vs actual length at the bottom.\r\n\r\n2. Use the Loop Debugging Checklist in your Unit Guide to check the for-loop in the code, and mark the item that reveals the bug.\r\n\r\n3. Adjust the for-loop so it runs the correct number of times, then retest with several numbers until expected and actual match every time.\r\n",
